		(descr "Kyohritsu ADC1804_F (PCM1804) 56x33mm measured FP. Origin=board center. Pitch 2.54. Header drill 1.0 / pad 1.8. M3 NPTH 3.2. Vertical silk orientation (manual top-view): CN2F(R top)=pads4-6, CN1F(L bottom)=pads1-3, CN3/4 top 2x5=7,8,9,10,14, CN6F RST bottom=11+14, CN7/8 pwr 2x3=12,13,14. Mother: 2.54 female sockets recommended. CN5F OVFL/OVFR omitted (NC).")
